New — `scripts/transcript_filter.py`: a working reference implementation
of the advisory monitor's read side. It digests a Claude Code `.jsonl`
transcript incrementally (noise filtering, resume offsets, safe stop at
the write frontier, subagent discovery) so a generated monitor does not
