### 2.1.1 (2026-08-18)

Changed — the stop-alignment hook now cools down: it blocks at most one stop
in three while a run is active (before: every other stop could block).
Generated workflows inherit the same counter through the hook template.
  - The session marker now holds a countdown instead of a flag. Override the
    cadence with `PAVE_INIT_STOP_EVERY` (minimum 2; the breaker always keeps
